<title>USA: WebSecure responds to shareholder suit.</title>
<headline>WebSecure responds to shareholder suit.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON, Mass. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>WebSecure Inc said Monday that there were no false or misleading statements in the prospectus for its recent initial public offering.</p>
<p>The company was responding to a lawsuit filed earlier against it by a shareholder, alleging that false and misleading information was included in the registration statement for the IPO.</p>
<p>&quot;We spent a lot of time doing that prospectus,&quot; said Robert Kuzara, in charge of investor relations.  &quot;All risk the factors were well-defined.  We stand by our prospectus.&quot;</p>
</text>
